# Smart Home Dashboard for CS 15 1st lab exam

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* **React Native:** Core framework for building the UI.
* **Expo:** Development platform and compiler.
* **React Navigation:** Handling transitions between the Home, Devices, and Device Details screens.
* **JavaScript/JSX:** Application logic and component structure.

## 📋 Prerequisites

Before you begin, ensure you have the following installed on your machine:
* [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) (which includes `npm`)
* Git

## 🚀 Installation & Setup

1. **Clone the repository:**
   ```bash
   git clone [https://github.com/YourUsername/YourRepoName.git](https://github.com/YourUsername/YourRepoName.git)
   cd YourRepoName
